Package: qt6-image-formats
Version: @DEB_QTIMAGEFORMATS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base
Description: Qt 6 extra image format plugins for the Xios desktop
 QImage plugins for TIFF, WebP, TGA, ICNS and WBMP. TIFF and WebP use the
 library copies bundled with Qt, so the package has no image library
 dependencies of its own.
 .
 Part of the Qt 6 stack for the KDE Plasma Mobile flavor of the Xios desktop.
